[h1]Harmony[/h1]
[b]Europa Universalis IV, made better from within.[/b] Crisp CJK & system fonts, instant no-restart returns to the main menu, measurably faster saves and ticks, and engine bug fixes — with vanilla rules untouched.

[list]
[*][b]Sharp CJK & system fonts:[/b] Native UTF-8 rendering with free bundled defaults for Simplified Chinese, Japanese and Korean plus live font preview — works directly with existing translation mods and saves.
[*][b]No-restart main menu & Ironman loading:[/b] Return to the main menu in seconds instead of restarting the game; load saves directly inside Ironman (with optional auto-save first).
[*][b]Measured speed-ups:[/b] 55 MB Ironman save freeze cut from ~1.2 s to ~0.35 s (~2/3 shorter), speed-5 frame stutter P99 reduced by ~70%, large-mod startup ~1/3 faster, smoother map zoom.
[*][b]Vanilla balance intact & open source:[/b] Fixes duplicate heir names and reload memory leaks, equalizes music loudness, optional relaxed achievements; 100% MIT open source.
[/list]
[i]Quick note: after subscribing, follow Installing below to copy [b]version.dll[/b] once — all future updates are automatic.[/i]

